sYU8Ca_btmAQ7kNvwHa2ajO&_nc_oc=AdpT2wDDsULVZOcYwM6OFdYUbrJrZ_c1qaTHM0Y07JQLhsJKsq5QVKbp1MsK7cisLwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGHwjCnR9dyt28yKDDT_BAA3UEAugijpW1rQjFr_VI_SQ&oe=6A8468B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P0dl2BaCzNIQ7kNvwF4cNwg&_nc_oc=Adp3ifxFwjgfHuQiAFIp1roUQ0jLUCLY1qeBCAdn9p_Ak9JfjnSAQrauvjt1NTDDJhw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGpIIXYWY91ORkpLMUXRCEXNZbvybO6phwTR65rEdM3Yg&oe=6A84320A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mGaQ-U_69agQ7kNvwERBA5X&_nc_oc=AdoJ3T2zBOZZljRMdcLYc6OesOOshvr7a6e5dYqyofYftoXGH1l9f_KvCyuALatXIKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF2Xr8SxEe81bzTxLndMhnd3fgkKWymluQeDundVJQZbg&oe=6A84576F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VWMa4c80HfEQ7kNvwGSb79R&_nc_oc=AdqSdKUHELe7dI3Z2BvmrwD8OeJJDJmUEL8Lm0nA4bPEf0puHlNg3es1QtEbtJyhdv0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHdNMqK_kYj5FxBErQxeIsJ9oGDE7Mhme2fue7n95PZFg&oe=6A8440C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sJKTPsraG94Q7kNvwFZBnSo&_nc_oc=AdrfF5CwBIs0e-LAJTCiq9q4mxSATpujW3rrqMHgMEEr109WzUiiuoCf5Kn8POb6rfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFf3UwGky-tGNMJgb51kTEMbgqy5D18tOCmM633YomsJg&oe=6A843918"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i53chw62BIEQ7kNvwE6EGrS&_nc_oc=AdrmaippIAmRF8roRvFzH4n8XGs2EZDFn8fp2wcbVRl87ilkO4ARN2SVyyvmcYmOzug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHvq1xdQhUJEveQk6AzkU50lHk3epEjenMg1mdTfsiIGw&oe=6A844C3C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080